WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.977
Welcome to Module 2. In Module 1, most statements ran from top to bottom.

00:00:05.977 --> 00:00:10.107
Now Python will start choosing paths and repeating work.

00:00:10.107 --> 00:00:16.712
Control flow is what lets a program apply rules, classify records, validate values,

00:00:16.712 --> 00:00:19.532
and process many observations automatically.
